id: pm-wqll
title: Propagate the docstring gate entry guard fix
description: "The isMainInvocation entry guard swallowed realpathSync ENOENT and returned false, causing npm run docstring to exit 0 having scanned nothing — a mandatory release gate reporting success without doing its job. Propagate the throw instead so a broken environment fails loudly."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[2]: docstrings,gate
created_at: "2026-08-10T05:42:30.239Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-10T05:42:43.260Z"
author: pi-agent
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-10T05:42:37.310Z",pi-agent,"Defect: isMainInvocation caught realpathSync ENOENT and returned false, so the top-level selector called the no-op placeholder instead of main. npm run docstring exited 0 having scanned nothing — a mandatory release check reporting success without doing its job."
  "2026-08-10T05:42:39.277Z",pi-agent,"Fix: removed the try/catch so realpathSync propagates. An unresolvable argv[1] means the environment is broken after Node already loaded this file, and a broken environment must not silently satisfy a gate. The JSDoc now documents @throws and corrects the inverted fails-closed language."
  "2026-08-10T05:42:43.259Z",pi-agent,"Verification: npm test passes (68 tests), npm run docstring exits 0 (26 files, 75 declarations), and node --experimental-strip-types confirms isMainInvocation throws ENOENT on an unresolvable argv[1] instead of returning false."
body: ""
